        "original_id": "a4595bfc-5d92-5158-88b1-da4e828e70f6",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Robin Weaver, Tamla Kari, Vicky Murdock, Carol Wiseman, Matthew Jacobs\n- Works: The Inbetweeners, The Inbetweeners Movie, The Inbetweeners 2, Somewhere to Run, The Musketeers\n- Organizations: E4, BBC\n- Roles: Pamela Cooper, Lucy, Constance Bonacieux\n\nFacts:\n- Robin Weaver starred with Vicky Murdock in Somewhere to Run, a film directed by Carol Wiseman and written by Matthew Jacobs about two teenage girls who run away from home and end up on the streets of London.\n- The Inbetweeners is an E4 sitcom.\n- The Inbetweeners Movie is a feature-length film based on the E4 sitcom The Inbetweeners.\n- The Inbetweeners 2 is a 2014 British comedy film and a sequel to The Inbetweeners Movie, which was released in 2011.\n- Robin Weaver is an English actress known for playing the recurring character Pamela Cooper in the E4 sitcom The Inbetweeners and in its feature-length films The Inbetweeners Movie and The Inbetweeners 2.\n- Tamla Kari is known for playing Constance Bonacieux in the BBC television series The Musketeers and Lucy in The Inbetweeners Movie and The Inbetweeners 2.",
